Alembic migration environment for StockInsight.

Initial revision: 0001_initial_schema (stocks, daily_prices,
technical_indicators, data_sync_jobs).

Use PostgreSQL 16 and DATABASE_URL with the postgresql+psycopg driver.
From the repository root:
  .venv/bin/alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head
  .venv/bin/alembic -c backend/alembic.ini current
  .venv/bin/alembic -c backend/alembic.ini check

The base downgrade drops all four tables and their data. Run it only on
disposable test databases. See README.md for isolated acceptance commands.
